swift-tr46
Copyright (c) 2026 GeoSpoof contributors

swift-tr46 is a Swift port of tr46 (https://github.com/jsdom/tr46), jsdom's
implementation of Unicode IDNA Compatibility Processing (UTS #46), and of the
Punycode implementation in punycode.js
(https://github.com/mathiasbynens/punycode.js). Both are MIT licensed. LICENSE
covers the port and carries the copyright notices of both projects.

Unicode data

This package contains data derived from Unicode data files:

- Sources/TR46/Generated/NFCTables.swift, the normalization tables, is
  generated from the Unicode 18.0.0 Character Database: UnicodeData.txt,
  CompositionExclusions.txt and DerivedNormalizationProps.txt.
- Sources/TR46/Generated/IDNATables.swift, the mapping and validity tables,
  re-encodes tr46 7.0.0's lib/mappingTable.json and lib/regexes.js, which tr46
  generates from Unicode 18.0.0 data files.
- The conformance test data in Tests/TR46Tests/Resources is derived from
  Unicode's NormalizationTest.txt, DerivedAge.txt and IdnaTestV2.txt.

